ram to scan memory.\n\n**Creating Necessary Files**\n\nI've confirmed that `/src/target.c` is indeed absent. My current focus is on creating this file and the associated `main()` function, as they appear to be essential for compiling the executable and running the test harness. I will proceed with generating this skeleton code.\n\n",
